{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12670","headline":"演兴四首 招太灵 · 元结","name":"演兴四首 招太灵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"招太灵兮山之巅，山屹𡵉兮水沦涟\n祠之櫴兮眇何年，木修修兮草鲜鲜。\n嗟魑魅兮淫厉，自古昔兮崇祭。\n禧太灵兮端清，予愿致夫精诚。\n久愵兮㤝㤝，招捃𢹝兮呼风\n风之声兮起颸颸，吹玄云兮散而浮。\n望太灵兮俨而安，澹油溶兮都清闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12670.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12670","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}